Cell["\<\
That boost block scaling is the local computational shadow of \
`boostCommutator_scales_with_kappa` in `OnePostulate/KinematicAlgebra.lean`.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2e4e1869-1de4-4bdf-b94c-8fb4ebdc24f5"],

Cell["Computing the Killing form", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4d38d10e-ad22-4e8d-bebb-5ab2b0b7ae07"],

Cell["\<\
The decisive invariant is computed before any geometry is interpreted. In the \
local Lean development this is `killing_form_diag` and \
`boost_killing_form_eq`.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a0e334aa-d914-4ea4-abd3-2182bbde18da"],

