Cell["Velocity-space and spacetime consequences", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"427077ec-ceac-4566-8b00-f560373e002b"],

Cell["\<\
The same kappa that scales the boost block fixes the velocity metric and the \
spacetime metric. Positive kappa gives a real invariant speed; zero kappa \
loses the canonical scale; negative kappa removes Lorentzian causal structure.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"48d53fc0-3c81-4d58-aaac-3008ca13641f"],

